msgctxt "64"
msgid "Argh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Finally coming to your senses?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"Never... I'll never forgive them... I'll never forgive\r\n"
"them for what they did...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"What exactly is your problem? You were one of them\r\n"
"once, weren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Yeah. That's right. When I was a kid, I joined the\r\n"
"yakuza."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "So what happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"I was a hitman for them, and they ordered me to off\r\n"
"key members of a rival family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"They promised me a big reward and a high position in\r\n"
"the family when my prison time was over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "I spent fifteen years dreaming of life after the slammer..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "I know how that feels."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"But when I finally got back to Kamurocho, the only thing\r\n"
"waiting for me was an assassin to shut me up for good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"During those fifteen years, they called a truce with that\r\n"
"rival family, and I just reminded them of past mistakes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "I managed to escape with my life, but I'd lost everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Ever since then, whenever I see someone in the yakuza,\r\n"
"I get pissed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Makes sense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "That story of yours isn't exactly uncommon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Look, I understand where you're coming from."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"But that's no reason to go around attacking people who\r\n"
"had nothing to do with what happened to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "The Honest Living Association sent me to come find you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "The HLA...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"You can talk this whole thing over there with Ibuki and\r\n"
"figure out what to do next."
msgstr ""

